---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="S2b · Wellsite survey plan sample" description="Well centre, lease boundary and access road on the Alberta Township System — in progress.">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Project S2b · Wellsite survey drafting</p>
      <h1>Wellsite survey plan sample</h1>
      <p class="lede">A fictitious wellsite set on the real Alberta Township System grid: well centre, lease boundary, access
        road, and distances to surrounding features, with the legal description expressed as LSD-Sec-Twp-Rge-W4M/W5M.</p>
      <span class="status planned">In progress</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Planned deliverables</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li>Well centre, lease boundary and access road plotted on the ATS grid, with a legal-description conversion script cross-checked against an official tool</li>
    <li>Area and distance tables generated automatically from the geometry</li>
    <li>Drawing carrying <code>SAMPLE – FICTITIOUS – NOT FOR LEGAL USE</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Still to confirm before drafting</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li>AER and ALSA content requirements for wellsite survey plans</li>
    <li>Source and licence for the public ATS grid data</li>
  </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
